WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:04.796
Roxy was sitting in class when her watch beeped.

2
00:00:04.797 --> 00:00:06.552
She raised her hand.

3
00:00:06.553 --> 00:00:09.169
"Miss Apricot, can I go to the nurse?

4
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:12.246
I, um, don't feel well."

5
00:00:12.247 --> 00:00:15.668
"Of course," Miss Apricot said.

6
00:00:15.669 --> 00:00:19.608
Terrell looked worried, but Roxy quickly gave him a thumbs-up.

7
00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:21.804
Terrell nodded and smiled.

8
00:00:21.805 --> 00:00:24.284
Roxy opened her watch in the hallway.

9
00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:26.163
Cozlin's face appeared.

10
00:00:26.164 --> 00:00:30.089
"Cozlin," Roxy said. "Is everything okay?"

11
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:34.176
Cozlin grunted. "I need your help!"

12
00:00:34.177 --> 00:00:37.674
"I already left school once today," Roxy said.

13
00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:39.557
"What do you need help with?"

14
00:00:39.558 --> 00:00:43.413
"This!" Cozlin moved her wrist so Roxy could see.

15
00:00:43.414 --> 00:00:48.769
Roxy gasped. Cozlin floated above a broken bridge.

16
00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:52.501
She was holding back a bunch of cars that were about to roll off.

17
00:00:52.502 --> 00:00:55.419
"How did that happen?" Roxy asked.

18
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.342
"Well . . ." Cozlin turned her wrist again.

19
00:00:59.343 --> 00:01:01.355
Roxy's eyes went wide.

20
00:01:01.356 --> 00:01:04.017
A huge dragon held a bus.

21
00:01:04.018 --> 00:01:07.245
Delkorians inside the bus shouted.

22
00:01:07.246 --> 00:01:10.032
Flames shot from the dragon's mouth.

23
00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.667
"Is that the . . . ?" Roxy scowled.

24
00:01:12.668 --> 00:01:15.423
"You stole the gold, didn't you?"

25
00:01:15.424 --> 00:01:17.269
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

26
00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.488
"Just jump through the portal when it opens. Please!"

27
00:01:21.489 --> 00:01:24.411
Voop! A portal opened.

28
00:01:24.412 --> 00:01:29.197
Roxy turned into Rocket Girl and jumped through.

29
00:01:29.198 --> 00:01:31.625
She landed on the roof of a building.

30
00:01:31.626 --> 00:01:33.787
It had an enormous hole.

31
00:01:33.788 --> 00:01:36.170
A Delkorian hurried over.

32
00:01:36.171 --> 00:01:38.748
"I'm Zark. You must be Rocket Girl.

33
00:01:38.749 --> 00:01:41.356
A dragon is destroying our city!"

34
00:01:41.357 --> 00:01:45.810
"Don't worry. I'll help Kid Comet." Roxy took off.

35
00:01:45.811 --> 00:01:48.727
She saw the broken bridge and flew to it.

36
00:01:48.728 --> 00:01:51.847
Cozlin was still holding back all the cars.

37
00:01:51.848 --> 00:01:55.732
"There are too many! I need your help!"

38
00:01:55.733 --> 00:01:59.048
Roxy grabbed a car and brought it to the ground.

39
00:01:59.049 --> 00:02:03.288
The Delkorian inside smiled. "Thank you so much!"

40
00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:07.016
Roxy flew back to the bridge and moved one car after another.

41
00:02:07.017 --> 00:02:11.215
Finally she and Cozlin brought the last two cars to the ground.

42
00:02:11.216 --> 00:02:14.735
Roar! The dragon soared over them.

43
00:02:14.736 --> 00:02:17.199
It still held the bus.

44
00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.099
Roxy and Cozlin shot toward the dragon.

45
00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:24.774
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams hit the dragon.

46
00:02:24.775 --> 00:02:32.425
The dragon threw the bus at her. Passengers screamed.

47
00:02:32.426 --> 00:02:36.162
Roxy caught the bus and set it down gently.

48
00:02:36.163 --> 00:02:40.566
The driver crawled out. "I need a new job!"

49
00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:44.359
Fwoosh! Flames shot toward Roxy.

50
00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:46.606
She blew her freeze breath at them.

51
00:02:46.607 --> 00:02:49.503
A cloud of smoke formed in the air.

52
00:02:49.504 --> 00:02:53.725
Zap! Zap! Cozlin fired lasers at the dragon.

53
00:02:53.726 --> 00:02:55.837
It spun around and chased her.

54
00:02:55.838 --> 00:02:57.677
Roxy caught up to her.

55
00:02:57.678 --> 00:02:59.883
Cozlin spoke into a device.

56
00:02:59.884 --> 00:03:02.681
"Zark! Get ready to open the portal!

57
00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:05.486
Hopefully the dragon will fly through it."

58
00:03:05.487 --> 00:03:08.395
"I'm ready!" Zark said.

59
00:03:08.396 --> 00:03:12.165
"We also need to return that gold," Roxy said.

60
00:03:12.166 --> 00:03:15.081
Cozlin sighed. "Fine."

61
00:03:15.082 --> 00:03:21.902
They flew fast, zigzagging to dodge the dragon's flames.

62
00:03:21.903 --> 00:03:24.144
"There's Zark!" Cozlin said.

63
00:03:24.145 --> 00:03:25.740
"I'll head straight toward him.

64
00:03:25.741 --> 00:03:28.472
Then, when he opens the portal, I'll turn quickly.

65
00:03:28.473 --> 00:03:30.973
Hopefully the dragon will fly right in!"

66
00:03:30.974 --> 00:03:33.162
Cozlin led the dragon toward the roof.

67
00:03:33.163 --> 00:03:35.867
Its jaws snapped at her feet.

68
00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:41.030
Roxy saw a portal pop open.

69
00:03:41.031 --> 00:03:44.044
Cozlin followed the plan and turned fast.

70
00:03:44.045 --> 00:03:45.981
But the dragon turned too.

71
00:03:45.982 --> 00:03:48.313
"Ugh!" Roxy thought.

72
00:03:48.314 --> 00:03:50.574
"That dragon's as fast as—"

73
00:03:50.575 --> 00:03:53.471
Voop! Another portal suddenly opened.

74
00:03:53.472 --> 00:04:01.416
Cozlin disappeared into it, and so did the dragon!

75
00:04:01.417 --> 00:04:04.299
Roxy rushed over to Zark.

76
00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.105
"Open the portal again!

77
00:04:06.106 --> 00:04:09.506
Kid Comet is trapped in the chamber with that dragon!"

78
00:04:09.507 --> 00:04:18.929
Zark looked shocked. "I didn't open that portal."

